  "body": "**What happens:** on main, `egui_app::tests::structural::shell_structure_dark` and `shell_structure_light` fail. They look for the toolbar label `v0.15.0 · test` (built from `env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\")`, structural.rs:75), but since #450 the toolbar shows the test-pinned `v0.0.0 · test`. Found by the review of PR #524.\n\n**Cause:** two merges that each passed alone: PR #359 (#255) added the structural tests with the real version, and PR #450 (#449) pinned the toolbar version to \"0.0.0\" under cfg(test).\n\n**Fix:** build the expected label from the same source the toolbar uses (`crate::build_info::toolbar_lines(false).0`), so a version bump or a re-pin can't split them again.\n\n**Done means:** both structural tests pass on main.\n",
